### Service manifest (no auth)
GET http://localhost:8084/

### Run a research query
POST http://localhost:8084/research
Authorization: Bearer klaro26_dev_key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "latest battery technologies",
  "depth": "standard"
}

### Poll the job (paste the id from the POST response)
GET http://localhost:8084/research/PASTE_JOB_ID
Authorization: Bearer klaro26_dev_key
